please see http://www2.ucsc.edu/ahr/academic.htm .  

A current list of the AMS faculty is as follows; for more information on
their interests and backgrounds please see

  http://www.ams.ucsc.edu/faculty.html

Neil Balmforth (Associate Professor, Head of Applied Mathematics Group, and
Associate Chair of AMS). Ph.D., Astrophysics, University of Cambridge,
1991. Astrophysics, chaos and dynamical systems, geological fluid
mechanics, fluid shear flows and vortices, synchronizing coupled systems.  

David Draper (Professor, Head of Statistics Group, and Chair of AMS;
