I have seen an application similar to what you are requesting for
moderately large data sets. THe idea is to fit a smooth, e.g. loess or
other, then fit a smooth to the points below the the original smooth and
another to those above it. With sufficient data, one could do this
several times. Potentially, this method could be used to examine
patterns in residuals from any model. 

