Local polynomial quantile regression has been looked at by P. Chaudhuri in
a 1991 Annals article (Annals of Statistics, 19, 760-777) and K. Yu and
M.C. Jones in a 1998 JASA article (JASA, 93, 228-237). Quantile smoothing
splines are another solution; see, e.g., the article by R. Koenker, P.T.
Ng, and S. Portnoy in 1994 Biometrika (Biometrika, 81, 673-680).

